# ChromaTube server side: copy this file to .env (same folder) and change both values.
# .env is ignored by Git. It holds no password or key.

# The folder the tool writes its .strm files into, as THIS machine (the Docker host) sees it.
# Jellyfin must see the same folder (note the path Jellyfin uses for it: that is --server-path later),
# and it must NOT be inside any existing library folder. Example: /srv/jellyfin-extra/ChromaTube
CHROMATUBE_LIST_FOLDER=/CHANGE/ME/ChromaTube
